// Settings help for INI Master, which reads this resource from the plugin's
// bytes without loading it. The resource type must be INIMETA. This is the
// same BountyTeleportation.ini the plugin embeds to write out on a first
// run, with a ;@mod line and two ;@ restart flags added; the game skips
// them like any other comment. Keep it in step with ReadSettings in mod.cpp.
BT_INIMETA INIMETA "../BountyTeleportation.ini"
